resources.string:
To ensure external power plug and unplug events are reliably detected even if recents are cleared:

1. Lock App in Recents: Open recent tasks, pull down or long press this card and tap the lock icon;

2. Allow Auto-start: Enable autostart permission in system app settings;

3. Unrestricted Battery: Set battery management to No Restrictions;

4. Enable Persistent Notification: Turn on the switch above to run foreground service.
